s: 8 working days\n\nReason: Family holiday trip\n\nI've ensured that all my current projects will be completed before my departure, and I've arranged for coverage during my absence.\n\nPlease let me know if this request is approved or if you need any additional information.\n\nThank you,\nYou\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.10014381018589925) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: vendor@supplies.com\nSubject: Contract Renewal Discussion\nDate: 2025-10-06T16:30:00Z\nStatus: Draft\nBody:\nDear Vendor Team,\n\nI hope you're doing well. I'm reaching out to discuss the renewal of our current contract which expires at the end of this month.\n\nWe've been very satisfied with your services over the past year. However, we'd like to discuss:\n\n1. Potential volume discounts for increased usage\n2. Extended support hours\n3. Additional service level agreements\n\nWould you be available for a call this week to discuss these points?\n\nLooking forward to continuing our partnership,\nVince\n",
